    "body": "## DUNCAN PRIME / WORKSTREAM B — MORNING READINESS GUARD\n\n**ROLE**\n`DUNCAN PRIME / WORKSTREAM B — WORLD / CAMERA / S001`\n\n**RESULT**\n- Fresh-read `main = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`.\n- Fresh-read `duncan/zorr-studio-r01 = f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665`.\n- Fresh #248 morning checkpoint confirms: `#248 = OPEN / ACTIVE GATE / NOT PASS`, `W01 = NOT EXECUTED`; current project blocker remains exact accepted source-handle/bytes + real visual execution on A's path.\n- Fresh MASTER hold order in #250 remains authoritative for B: `B = FROZEN TO CONSISTENCY / READINESS ONLY` while #248 is active.\n- Fresh-read existing B contracts on current studio HEAD:\n  - `studio/CAMERA_LAYOUT_VISUAL_R01.md`\n  - `studio/S001_SHOT_CONTRACT_R01.md`\n  - `studio/S001_PHYSICAL_SOURCE_CONTRACT_R01.md`\n- No B file mutation, new architecture, physical asset, image execution, world lock, camera PASS, Babylon detour, or numeric S001 lock was made.\n\n**CONFLICT CHECK**\n- W01..W06 witness protocol explicitly makes diagnostic witness framing evidence-only, forbids environment dependency, forbids hiding required anchors, forbids camera distortion that blocks comparison, and forbids treating witness framing as a camera/world lock.\n- `CAMERA_LAYOUT_VISUAL_R01` does not impose a current shot framing on A; it waits for legal upstream handoff, then binds protected anchors and measures in output px.\n- `S001_SHOT_CONTRACT_R01` keeps `9:16 = ASSUMPTION` only; output raster, FPS, duration, framing, overscan, translation/push/roll, depth order and tolerances remain `NOT_PROVEN`.\n- `S001_PHYSICAL_SOURCE_CONTRACT_R01` requires the future CHAR package to bind an exact approved pose/key state and preserve costume attachment invariants; camera/world integration is forbidden from silently repairing character mechanics through redesign.\n- Therefore no prepared B assumption currently constrains W01..W06 geometry/framing in a way that would force witness rework.\n\n`B_TO_A_CONFLICT = NONE_PROVEN`\n\n**B READY STATE**\n`B_PREP_READINESS = READY`\n`B_EXECUTION_STATE = FROZEN`\n`B_CONFLICT_STATE = NO_CONFLICT`\n\nThis READY state means only that the existing PREP contracts are internally consistent and non-blocking for A. It is **not** CAMERA/WORLD/S001 production PASS.\n\n**BLOCKER**\n- `B_BLOCKER = NONE` for readiness.\n- Current project blocker is upstream and A-owned: exact accepted source bytes/handles must coexist with a real visual execution surface before W01 ARM_RAISE can be honestly executed.\n\n**WHAT B MUST NOT TOUCH**\n- no new CAMERA/WORLD/S001 architecture/spec expansion;\n- no unresolved S001 numeric values;\n- no physical S001 build;\n- no image generation/editing;\n- no camera PASS or world lock;\n- no Babylon-first detour;\n- no character/costume/pose redesign;\n- no merge/main mutation/canon promotion.\n\n**ACTIVATION CONDITIONS**\nB leaves frozen state only after the legal chain reaches:\n\n`#248 COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 = PASS`\n`-> POSE_MECHANICS_VISUAL_R01 = PASS`\n`-> CHAT C / MASTER explicitly opens CAMERA_LAYOUT_VISUAL_R01`\n\nThen, and only then:\n1. bind the exact approved pose/key state to the camera contract;\n2. resolve actual S001 aspect/output/FPS/duration/framing/overscan/camera envelope/depth order without borrowing smoke defaults;\n3. bind exact BG/MID/FG/CHAR source revisions and registration anchors;\n4. create only legally authorized layout witnesses;\n5. measure px-first protected anchors, source coverage, parallax, occlusion and contact/grounding;\n6. return measured evidence to CHAT C for legal PASS/FAIL promotion.\n\n**NEXT**\n`HOLD / NO B EXPANSION` until CHAT C exposes a concrete dependency/conflict or the upstream legal chain reaches `#248 PASS -> POSE PASS`.\n\n`DOWNSTREAM_PASS = NOT_CLAIMED`\n`PHYSICAL_S001_BUILD = NOT_AUTHORIZED`",
